==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hannya]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]]s spawn, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Hannya's lack of support makes for an easy fight. [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] walls Hannya and Doctor K.O for comedic lengths of time, while Owlbrowley quickly dies to [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] spam. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] serves as a great attacker for both Doctor K.O. and Hannya. If Hannya or any enemy pushes too much, [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] can help a lot by damaging annoying support.
[[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)| Carpenter Cat]] is also a great choice of meatshield due to his resistance ability against Red and Sage Slayer, giving him a high effective health against Hannya, Doctor K.O and Owlbrowley.

